{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07993","headline":"古风 五十五 · 李白","name":"古风 五十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"齐瑟弹东吟，秦弦弄西音。\n慷慨动颜魄，使人成荒淫。\n彼美佞邪子，婉娈来相寻。\n一笑双白璧，再歌千黄金。\n珍色不贵道，讵惜飞光沈。\n安识紫霞客，瑶台鸣素琴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07993.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07993","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}